---
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslations } from "../../../i18n/utils";

const t = useTranslations(getLangFromUrl(Astro.url));
---

<p class="text-lg text-justify text-black leading-8 tracking-wide mb-8">
  My journey into programming began almost accidentally—with a game called
  <a
    href="https://codecombat.com/user/cararcel"
    target="_blank"
    class="font-bold underline hover:no-underline">CodeCombat</a
  >.that turned learning into play. What started as curiosity quickly grew into
  genuine interest, leading me to explore web technologies through platforms
  like
  <a
    href="https://laracasts.com/"
    target="_blank"
    class="font-bold underline hover:no-underline">Laracasts</a
  >
  and
  <a
    href="https://grafikart.fr"
    target="_blank"
    class="font-bold underline hover:no-underline">Grafikart</a
  >.
</p>

<p class="text-lg text-justify text-black leading-8 tracking-wide mb-8">
  I decided to formalize my self-taught knowledge by enrolling in a structured
  program at
  <a
    href="https://openclassrooms.com/fr/paths/899-developpeur-web"
    target="_blank"
    class="font-bold underline hover:no-underline">OpenClassrooms</a
  >. Now I can say I am
  <a
    href="/assets/oc-certificat.pdf"
    title="my OpenClassrooms certificate"
    target="_blank"
    class="font-bold underline hover:no-underline"
  >
    officially a web developer
  </a>. Hoorray!!
</p>

<p class="text-lg text-justify text-black leading-8 tracking-wide mb-8">
  Today, I work building responsive web applications and continuously expanding
  my skill set. I approach each project applying the analytical rigor from my
  biochemistry. Based in Belgium, I'm actively seeking opportunities to join a
  collaborative team where I can contribute meaningfully while continuing to
  grow as a developer.
</p>
